  "description": "Stranded in the middle of the desert with no food, water, or purpose, Raissa's luck turns around when Esther, a djinn who can grant temporary wishes, falls into her lap (literally). Teaming up to find a legendary artifact that can permanently grant any wish asked of it, no matter how impossible, the two set off on an adventure to fulfill their deepest desires: Esther to become human, and Raissa to bring back her missing father. But they aren't the only ones with improbable wishes, and they'll need to work together to fend off the competition.",
